                                                "sense_id": "3870407e-8e3f-33d8-b2de-5f757bb7c919",
                                                "text": "Dafydd ap Ivan ap Einion, an adherent to the house of Lancaster held out, in Harlech Castle, for nine years after the accession of Edward the Fourth to the throne of England."
